Lab 11: Regular Maintenance of Ansible Platform
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Perform routine maintenance tasks to keep the Ansible Automation Platform secure and up-to-date
Update Automation Controller and Hub components using best practices
Monitor platform performance using built-in monitoring tools and metrics
